  "ID": "35803",
  "post_title": "Multitudinaria comida de paella en la Morería de Onda para poner fin a las fiestas",
  "post_date": "2013-04-15 12:25:45",
  "post_name": "multitudinaria-comida-de-paella-en-la-moreria-de-onda-para-poner-fin-a-las-fiestas",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>La multitudinaria comida de paella ha centrado este domingo el fin de las fiestas del barrio de la Morer&iacute;a en Onda, acompa&ntilde;ada de la <a href=\"http://www.eltriangulo.es/contenidos/?p=35760\" target=\"_blank\">II Feria de Artesan&iacute;a, que ha ocupado sus calles durante todo el d&iacute;a</a>.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/04/IMG_4522.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Ha habido tambi&eacute;n atracciones infantiles durante la ma&ntilde;ana y la tarde, y se han entregado los premios de los concursos de dibujo infantil, todos para ni&ntilde;as, y de paellas.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdiumengefestesmoreria13/img_4486.jpg\" alt=\"img_4486\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdiumengefestesmoreria13/img_4487.jpg\" alt=\"img_4487\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdiumengefestesmoreria13/img_4488.jpg\" alt=\"img_4488\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdiumengefestesmoreria13/img_4489.jpg\" alt=\"img_4489\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdiumengefestesmoreria13/img_4490.jpg\" alt=\"img_4490\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdiumengefestesmoreria13/img_4491.jpg\" alt=\"img_4491\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdiumengefestesmoreria13/img_4492.jpg\" alt=\"img_4492\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ultimdiumengefestesmorer